From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Domenico D'Arrigo <d.darrigo@outlook.it>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 14:30:25 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] UefiPayloadPkg: Tell coreboot that the firmware booted

[ouroBIOS: patches/edk2/0014, without the files that TianoCore's tree
does not have (tools/edk2-import.py): 3 in edk2/OuroBiosPkg (3 in a
directory of TianoCore's that the package carries whole)]

coreboot with vboot and two RW slots tries a new slot for a few boots
after an update, and falls back to the other slot when the tries run
out, unless a boot records that the new slot works. On ChromeOS the OS
does it; here the payload knows first.

Add SmmStoreLibVbootSlotGood(), which sends SMMSTORE_CMD_VBOOT_SLOT_GOOD
to the SMMSTORE handler of coreboot, and call it from
PlatformBootManagerAfterConsole(): a slot that boots the payload to its
console is kept. Without vboot, coreboot answers that the command is
unsupported, and nothing changes.

TEST=tools/qemu-update.py of ouroBIOS at every build: after a capsule
the payload reports the new slot good ("firmware slot marked good:
Success") and vboot keeps it; the releases installed with capsules on
the W541 stay on the new slot.

Co-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018n3yuWwDLW63F4vdf7ZFTv

---
diff --git a/UefiPayloadPkg/Include/Library/SmmStoreLib.h b/UefiPayloadPkg/Include/Library/SmmStoreLib.h
index 950ecf826..fab6c3385 100644
--- a/UefiPayloadPkg/Include/Library/SmmStoreLib.h
+++ b/UefiPayloadPkg/Include/Library/SmmStoreLib.h
@@ -160,6 +160,21 @@ SmmStoreLibEndAnyBlockAccess (
   VOID
   );
 
+/**
+  Tell coreboot that the firmware booted: if vboot is trying the RW slot that
+  runs, the slot works and is kept.
+
+  @retval EFI_SUCCESS      coreboot recorded it, or had nothing to record.
+  @retval EFI_NO_MEDIA     SmmStore is not initialized.
+  @retval EFI_UNSUPPORTED  coreboot has no vboot nvdata in flash.
+  @retval others           The handler failed.
+
+**/
+EFI_STATUS
+SmmStoreLibVbootSlotGood (
+  VOID
+  );
+
 /**
   Function to update a pointer on virtual address change.  Matches the signature
   and operation of EfiConvertPointer.
diff --git a/UefiPayloadPkg/Library/SmmStoreLib/SmmStore.c b/UefiPayloadPkg/Library/SmmStoreLib/SmmStore.c
index 875b7269b..e7a6b73c7 100644
--- a/UefiPayloadPkg/Library/SmmStoreLib/SmmStore.c
+++ b/UefiPayloadPkg/Library/SmmStoreLib/SmmStore.c
@@ -408,6 +408,28 @@ SmmStoreLibEndAnyBlockAccess (
   return CallSmm (mSmmStoreInfo->ApmCmd, SMMSTORE_CMD_USE_FULL_FLASH, 0);
 }
 
+/**
+  Tell coreboot that the firmware booted: if vboot is trying the RW slot that
+  runs, the slot works and is kept.
+
+  @retval EFI_SUCCESS      coreboot recorded it, or had nothing to record.
+  @retval EFI_NO_MEDIA     SmmStore is not initialized.
+  @retval EFI_UNSUPPORTED  coreboot has no vboot nvdata in flash.
+  @retval others           The handler failed.
+
+**/
+EFI_STATUS
+SmmStoreLibVbootSlotGood (
+  VOID
+  )
+{
+  if (mSmmStoreInfo == NULL) {
+    return EFI_NO_MEDIA;
+  }
+
+  return CallSmm (mSmmStoreInfo->ApmCmd, SMMSTORE_CMD_VBOOT_SLOT_GOOD, mArgComBufPhys);
+}
+
 /**
   Fixup internal data so that EFI can be called in virtual mode.
   Converts any pointers in lib to virtual mode. This function is meant to
diff --git a/UefiPayloadPkg/Library/SmmStoreLib/SmmStore.h b/UefiPayloadPkg/Library/SmmStoreLib/SmmStore.h
index 6d776756c..2e78cc89e 100644
--- a/UefiPayloadPkg/Library/SmmStoreLib/SmmStore.h
+++ b/UefiPayloadPkg/Library/SmmStoreLib/SmmStore.h
@@ -19,6 +19,11 @@
 #define SMMSTORE_CMD_RAW_WRITE  6
 #define SMMSTORE_CMD_RAW_CLEAR  7
 
+//
+// coreboot with vboot: mark the RW slot being tried as working.
+//
+#define SMMSTORE_CMD_VBOOT_SLOT_GOOD  8
+
 /* Used by capsule updates as a standalone command or modifier to v2 commands */
 #define SMMSTORE_CMD_USE_FULL_FLASH  0x80
 
-- 
2.43.0

